<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>Thank You for Contacting Thread Security</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
      background-color: #0b0f19;
      color: #e2e8f0;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 40px auto;
      background: #111827;
      border: 1px solid #1f2937;
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
    }
    .header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e1b4b 0%, #311042 100%);
      padding: 35px 20px;
      text-align: center;
      border-bottom: 2px solid #a855f7;
    }
    .header h1 {
      color: #ffffff;
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }
    .content {
      padding: 30px 25px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      font-size: 15px;
      color: #cbd5e1;
    }
    .accent-text {
      color: #818cf8;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .details-box {
      background: #1f2937;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 15px;
      margin: 20px 0;
      border-left: 3px solid #a855f7;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .details-title {
      font-size: 11px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      color: #94a3b8;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .footer {
      background-color: #0d111c;
      padding: 20px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #64748b;
      border-top: 1px solid #1f2937;
    }
    .footer a {
      color: #818cf8;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>Thank You for Choosing Us</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
      <p>Hello <span class="accent-text">{{name}}</span>,</p>
      <p>Thank you for reaching out to <strong>Thread Security</strong>. We have received your enquiry regarding <span class="accent-text" style="text-transform: capitalize;">{{interest}}</span>.</p>
      <p>Our team of security experts is reviewing your message, and we'll connect with you within a moment!</p>
      
      <div class="details-box">
        <div class="details-title">Your Submission Details</div>
        <strong>Subject:</strong> {{interest}}<br>
        <strong>Submitted At:</strong> {{submittedAt}}
      </div>

      <p>If you have any urgent questions, feel free to reply directly to this email.</p>
      <p>Best regards,<br><strong>Thread Security Team</strong></p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      &copy; 2026 Thread Security. All rights reserved.<br>
      Visit our website: <a href="https://threadsecurity.in">threadsecurity.in</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
